---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---


<PageLayout>
  <h1 class="fancy-text text-[2.6em]">Welcome to this Astro Starter!</h1>

  <p>
    This starter is a batteries-included starting point for anyone looking
    to build a website with <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a>, <a href="https://www.typescriptlang.org/">Typescript</a> and <a href="https://tailwindcss.com/">TailwindCSS</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    It comes with a few integrations, plugins and fonts already configured in the <code>astro.config.mjs</code> file. You can customize this setup with <a href="https://astro.build/integrations">Astro Integrations</a> to add tools like React, Vue or Solid to this project.
  </p>
  <p>Here are some ideas to get started with this template:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Edit this page in <code>src/pages/index.astro</code></li>
    <li>Check out the included blog posts in <code>src/content/blog/</code></li>
    <li>Customize the blog post page layout in <code>src/layouts/PostLayout.astro</code></li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Have fun! If you get stuck, remember to read the <a href="https://docs.astro.build/">Astro docs</a> or join the <a href="https://astro.build/chat">Astro Discord</a> to ask questions.
  </p>
  <p>
    Looking for themes? Check out <a href="https://astro.build/themes/">all Astro themes</a>.
  </p>
  <br>
  <p>
    <a class="fancy-btn" href="../blog">
      Launch the blog!
    </a>
  </p>
</PageLayout>
